OL,3,GNEWSA'Ade starring in I'm A Celeb... is
OL,4,Aa proud moment for Birmingham'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAde Adepitan made history on Monday as
OL,7,Fthe first wheelchair user to enter the
OL,8,Fjungle on I'm A Celebrity... and even
OL,9,Fjumping out of a plane to get there.
OL,11,FThe paralympian and documentary maker's
OL,12,Fdebut is a special moment for
OL,13,FBirmingham as Adepitan is also
OL,14,FChancellor of Birmingham City
OL,15,FUniversity (BCU).
OL,17,FAnita Bhalla, BCU's chair of governors,
OL,18,Fsaid the university and its students
OL,19,Fwere "so, so, so proud".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
