OL,3,GNEWSA'Ade starring in I'm A Celeb... is
OL,4,Aa proud moment for Birmingham'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He's jolly, he works really hard, he
OL,7,Fis committed, he loves a challenge and
OL,8,Fhe wants to do all the challenges. He
OL,9,Fdoesn't want to be sitting on the
OL,10,Fsidelines," former broadcaster and BBC
OL,11,Fexecutive Bhalla said.
